    "order": 1,
    "title": "Our Vision",
    "eyebrow": "",
    "content": "<div class=\"split w-full\" style=\"position:relative;z-index:1;\">\n<div>\n<p style=\"font-size:10px;letter-spacing:0.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--gold);margin-bottom:0.75rem;\">Mission</p>\n<p class=\"body-text\">To combine traditional services with modern technological advancements, ensuring robust and sustainable growth across all sectors we touch.</p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p style=\"font-size:10px;letter-spacing:0.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--blue);margin-bottom:0.75rem;\">Vision</p>\n<p class=\"body-text\">By emphasizing innovation and reliability, we aim to be the foundational partner for enterprises navigating the complexities of tomorrow's market.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"divider\"></div>\n<div class=\"grid-3\">\n<div class=\"service-card\" style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined icon\" style=\"display:block;font-size:36px;text-align:center;\">lightbulb</span>\n<h6>Innovation</h6>\n<p>Pioneering new methodologies and frameworks.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"service-card\" style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined icon\" style=\"display:block;font-size:36px;text-align:center;color:var(--blue);\">verified_user</span>\n<h6>Trust</h6>\n<p>Built on absolute transparency and integrity.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"service-card\" style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined icon\" style=\"display:block;font-size:36px;text-align:center;color:var(--text-dim);\">trending_up</span>\n<h6>Growth</h6>\n<p>Sustainable and exponential scaling.</p>\n</div>\n</div>",
