    "order": 2,
    "title": "Build the Future",
    "eyebrow": "Infrastructure",
    "content": "<div class=\"split w-full\" style=\"position:relative;z-index:1;\">\n<div>\n<p class=\"body-text\" style=\"margin-bottom:2rem;\">We design and build the physical frameworks of the future. From concept to concrete, our project management ensures resilience and aesthetic excellence.</p>\n<div>\n<div class=\"icon-row\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined\">home_work</span><span>Residential Construction</span></div>\n<div class=\"icon-row\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined\">domain</span><span>Commercial Construction</span></div>\n<div class=\"icon-row\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined\">architecture</span><span>Renovation &amp; Design</span></div>\n<div class=\"icon-row\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined\">engineering</span><span>End-to-End Project Management</span></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"margin-top:2rem;\">\n<a class=\"btn-primary\" href=\"#\">Request a Quote</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:1rem;\">\n<div class=\"img-overlay\" style=\"height:220px;\">\n<img alt=\"Construction\" src=\"/static/images/7014b225e5ae3b0512bf68906380f56f.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n<div class=\"img-overlay\" style=\"height:220px;margin-top:2rem;\">\n<img alt=\"Blueprint\" src=\"/static/images/a6a5de9becaa7c0ed40eae0a8f5b5b69.jpg;fit=crop&amp;q=80&amp;w=600\"/>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
