    "order": 3,
    "title": "AI Market Intelligence",
    "eyebrow": "Intelligence",
    "content": "<div class=\"split w-full\" style=\"position:relative;z-index:1;\">\n<div>\n<p class=\"body-text\" style=\"margin-bottom:2rem;\">Deploying neural networks and algorithmic research to predict market trends. We turn raw financial data into actionable, automated strategies.</p>\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:1rem;\">\n<div class=\"service-card\" style=\"border-color:var(--blue-dim);\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-bottom:0.5rem;\">\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined\" style=\"font-size:18px;color:var(--blue);\">show_chart</span>\n<h6 style=\"font-size:1.1rem;\">AI Prediction Tools</h6>\n</div>\n<p>Advanced forecasting models for equities and commodities.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"service-card\" style=\"border-color:var(--gold-dim);\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-bottom:0.5rem;\">\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined\" style=\"font-size:18px;color:var(--gold);\">memory</span>\n<h6 style=\"font-size:1.1rem;\">Algorithmic Trading</h6>\n</div>\n<p>High-frequency automated execution strategies.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"service-card\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-bottom:0.5rem;\">\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined\" style=\"font-size:18px;color:var(--text-dim);\">analytics</span>\n<h6 style=\"font-size:1.1rem;\">Data Analytics</h6>\n</div>\n<p>Deep structural analysis of market sentiment.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:1rem;\">\n<div class=\"img-overlay\" style=\"height:260px;\">\n<img alt=\"Stock Chart\" src=\"/static/images/41ee7ffa4a0d70a4f2ee198046ec7f3b.jpg;fit=crop&amp;q=80&amp;w=700\"/>\n<div style=\"position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(74,144,217,0.2),transparent 60%);pointer-events:none;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"grid-3\" style=\"grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);\">\n<div class=\"stat-card\">\n<p class=\"label\">Accuracy</p>\n<p class=\"value\">94<span style=\"font-size:1rem;color:var(--text-muted);\">%</span></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stat-card\">\n<p class=\"label\">Markets</p>\n<p class=\"value\">12<span style=\"font-size:1rem;color:var(--text-muted);\">+</span></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stat-card\">\n<p class=\"label\">Active Bots</p>\n<p class=\"value\">48</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
