    "order": 4,
    "title": "Systems That Scale",
    "eyebrow": "Digital Engineering",
    "content": "<p class=\"body-text\" style=\"max-width:700px;margin-bottom:2.5rem;\">We engineer bespoke digital tools tailored to specific enterprise needs. From robust backend architectures to seamless AI integrations, we build systems that grow with you.</p>\n<div class=\"grid-4\">\n<div class=\"service-card\">\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined icon\">dns</span>\n<h6>Enterprise Software</h6>\n<p>Scalable platforms for massive organizational loads.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"service-card\">\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined icon\">smart_button</span>\n<h6>Automation</h6>\n<p>Streamlining repetitive tasks with intelligent scripts.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"service-card\">\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined icon\">psychology</span>\n<h6>AI Integrations</h6>\n<p>Embedding large language models into workflows.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"service-card\">\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined icon\">construction</span>\n<h6>Custom Tools</h6>\n<p>Dashboards, CRM extensions, and specialized utilities.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"divider\"></div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;gap:1rem;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;\">\n<a class=\"btn-primary\" href=\"#\">Start a Project</a>\n<span style=\"font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.1rem;font-style:italic;color:var(--text-muted);\">From MVP to enterprise — we cover it all.</span>\n</div>",
