    "order": 6,
    "title": "Balance & Wellness",
    "eyebrow": "Vitality",
    "content": "<p class=\"body-text\" style=\"max-width:620px;margin-bottom:2.5rem;\">Holistic strategy is not an indulgence — it is a prerequisite for intellectual endurance. We facilitate peak human performance through ancient wisdom translated for the modern executive.</p>\n<div class=\"grid-3\">\n<div class=\"wellness-item\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;padding:1rem;border:1px solid rgba(201,168,76,0.15);border-radius:14px;background:rgba(201,168,76,0.05);transition:all 0.3s ease;\">\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined\" style=\"font-size:32px;color:var(--gold);\">self_improvement</span>\n<div><p style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:500;margin-bottom:2px;\">Yoga Training</p><p style=\"font-size:11px;color:var(--text-muted);\">Daily &amp; corporate</p></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wellness-item\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;padding:1rem;border:1px solid rgba(74,144,217,0.15);border-radius:14px;background:rgba(74,144,217,0.05);transition:all 0.3s ease;\">\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined\" style=\"font-size:32px;color:var(--blue);\">spa</span>\n<div><p style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:500;margin-bottom:2px;\">Meditation</p><p style=\"font-size:11px;color:var(--text-muted);\">Guided programs</p></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wellness-item\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;padding:1rem;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:14px;background:var(--surface);transition:all 0.3s ease;\">\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined\" style=\"font-size:32px;color:var(--text-dim);\">groups</span>\n<div><p style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:500;margin-bottom:2px;\">Corporate Sessions</p><p style=\"font-size:11px;color:var(--text-muted);\">Team wellness</p></div>\n</div>\n</div>",
