    "title": "Secure Your Future",
    "eyebrow": "Protection & Asset",
    "content": "<div class=\"grid-2 w-full\">\n<div class=\"secure-card\" style=\"padding-left:1.5rem;border-left:2px solid var(--gold-dim);padding-bottom:1.5rem;transition:border-color 0.4s ease;\">\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined\" style=\"font-size:44px;color:var(--blue);margin-bottom:1rem;display:block;\">account_balance</span>\n<h3 class=\"title-md\" style=\"margin-bottom:1rem;\">Insurance &amp; Investment</h3>\n<p class=\"body-text\" style=\"margin-bottom:1.5rem;font-size:0.9rem;\">Authorized LIC insurance consulting to safeguard legacies. Comprehensive investment planning ensuring capital preservation and compound growth across generations.</p>\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:0.15em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--gold);\">— LIC Insurance</span>\n<span style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:0.15em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--gold);\">— Financial Planning</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"secure-card\" style=\"padding-left:1.5rem;border-left:2px solid var(--blue-dim);padding-bottom:1.5rem;transition:border-color 0.4s ease;\">\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined\" style=\"font-size:44px;color:var(--gold);margin-bottom:1rem;display:block;\">real_estate_agent</span>\n<h3 class=\"title-md\" style=\"font-style:italic;margin-bottom:1rem;\">Property &amp; Real Estate</h3>\n<p class=\"body-text\" style=\"margin-bottom:1.5rem;font-size:0.9rem;\">Strategic property buying, selling, and real estate advisory. We identify high-yield commercial and residential opportunities in emerging corridors.</p>\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:0.15em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--blue);\">— Real Estate Advisory</span>\n<span style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:0.15em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--blue);\">— Buying &amp; Selling</spa