    "title": "Begin Your Journey",
    "eyebrow": "Final Station",
    "content": "<p class=\"body-text\" style=\"max-width:480px;margin:0 auto;\">Connecting vision with execution. Reach out for a consultation to transform your enterprise operations.</p>\n<div class=\"split w-full\" style=\"gap:3rem;margin-top:3rem;\">\n<div>\n<div style=\"margin-bottom:2rem;\">\n<p style=\"font-size:10px;letter-spacing:0.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--gold);margin-bottom:8px;\">Direct Line</p>\n<a class=\"contact-link\" href=\"tel:{{ site_settings.phone }}\">{{ site_settings.phone }}</a>\n</div>\n<div style=\"margin-bottom:2rem;\">\n<p style=\"font-size:10px;letter-spacing:0.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--blue);margin-bottom:8px;\">Electronic Mail</p>\n<a class=\"contact-link\" href=\"mailto:{{ site_settings.email }}\" style=\"font-size:clamp(0.85rem,1.5vw,1.1rem);\">{{ site_settings.email }}</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"divider\"></div>\n<a class=\"btn-whatsapp\" href=\"https://wa.me/{{ site_settings.phone|urlencode }}\">\n<svg viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M17.472 14.382c-.297-.149-1.758-.867-2.03-.967-.273-.099-.471-.148-.67.15-.197.297-.767.966-.94 1.164-.173.199-.347.223-.644.075-.297-.15-1.255-.463-2.39-1.475-.883-.788-1.48-1.761-1.653-2.059-.173-.297-.018-.458.13-.606.134-.133.298-.347.446-.52.149-.174.198-.298.298-.497.099-.198.05-.371-.025-.52-.075-.149-.669-1.612-.916-2.207-.242-.579-.487-.5-.669-.51a12.8 12.8 0 0 0-.57-.01c-.198 0-.52.074-.792.372-.272.297-1.04 1.016-1.04 2.479 0 1.462 1.065 2.875 1.213 3.074.149.198 2.096 3.2 5.077 4.487.709.306 1.262.489 1.694.625.712.227 1.36.195 1.871.118.571-.085 1.758-.719 2.006-1.413.248-.694.248-1.289.173-1.413-.074-.124-.272-.198-.57-.347m-5.421 7.403h-.004a9.87 9.87 0 0 1-5.031-1.378l-.361-.214-3.741.982.998-3.648-.235-.374a9.86 9.86 0 0 1-1.51-5.26c.001-5.45 4.436-9.884 9.888-9.884 2.64 0 5.122 1.03 6.988 2.898a9.825 9.825 0 0 1 2.893 6.994c-.003 5.45-4.437 9.884-9.885 9.884m8.413-18.297A11.815 11.815 0 0 0 12.05 0C5.495 0 .16 5.335.157 11.892c0 2.096.547 4.142 1.588 5.945L.057 24l6.305-1.654a11.882 11.882 0 0 0 5.683 1.448h.005c6.554 0 11.89-5.335 11.893-11.893a11.821 11.821 0 0 0-3.48-8.413Z\"></path></svg>\n            Chat on WhatsApp\n          </a>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div style=\"background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:16px;padding:2rem;\">\n<div class=\"form-group\">\n<label for=\"c-name\">Name</label>\n<input id=\"c-name\" placeholder=\"Your full name\" type=\"text\"/>\n</div>\n<div class=\"form-group\">\n<label for=\"c-email\">Email</label>\n<input id=\"c-email\" placeholder=\"address@domain.com\" type=\"email\"/>\n</div>\n<div class=\"form-group\">\n<label for=\"c-msg\">Inquiry</label>\n<textarea id=\"c-msg\" placeholder=\"How can we assist your enterprise?\" rows=\"4\"></textarea>\n</div>\n<button class=\"btn-primary pointer-events-auto\" onclick=\"window.handleSubmit(this)\" style=\"width:100%;justify-content:center;border-radius:12px;\">\n              Initiate Transmission\n            </button>\n<div id=\"form-status\" style=\"display:none;margin-top:1rem;text-align:center;font-size:13px;color:var(--gold);\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
